            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>FULL RELEASE UPDATE - STEP INTO THE ARENA!</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 3 new levels and 5 old ones now feature Arena gameplay! Experience endless<br>variety by progressing through increasing difficulties of randomly generated waves of<br>enemies.<br></li><li> Endless wave! Survive any of the arenas for as long as you can against endless<br>hordes.<br></li><li> Daily challenge! Endless wave on the arena map of the day, where each day a new<br>set of enemies is served so that everyone playing faces exactly the same challenge.<br></li><li> Added leaderboards for all 3 arena modes. Who can survive arena the longest?<br></li><li> Multiplayer characters! Chose between Serious Sam or Serious Sammy.</p><br><h1>UPDATE 7 - SKILLS AND POWER-UPS</h1><p></li><li>Fight your way through waves of pesky aliens using the brand new skills and power-ups system.<br></li><li>Earn skill points by completing planets, higher the difficulty more skill points you earn.<br></li><li>Unlock weapon upgrades by completing perfect runs.<br></li><li>Lay waste on your enemies with tactical orbital lasers and plasma cannons, slow down time, improve and overcharge your weapons, create holographic decoys, release swarms of flying quadcopters, unleash an army of spiders, place minigun turret defenses, or simply create giant explosions!<br></li><li>Various visual and gameplay fixes and lots of stability fixes and optimizations, as usual. Check out the discussion boards for the full changelog.</p><br><h1>UPDATE 6 - ARCADIA UPDATE NOW AVAILABLE!</h1><p></li><li>Planet Arcadia is now available. Fight your way through four different locations: Sea Breeze, Meadow of Death, The Lost Valley and The Final Breath<br></li><li>Four new enemies<br></li><li>New giant boss. And he has a crush on you!<br></li><li>Feeling overwhelmed? Try out the devastating cannon. <br></li><li>As usual, update includes tons of fixes, tweaks and optimizations. Check out discussion our boards for the full changelog.</p><br><h1>UPDATE 5 - VALTOS IS HERE!</h1><p></li><li>New planet Valtos with four different locations: The Swamp, Ancient Breeze, The Old Forest and Green Dream<br></li><li>2 new additions to Sam's arsenal: a bow with piercing/explosive arrows and the deadly Devastator<br></li><li>6 new enemies<br></li><li>1 new boss, as scary as it is slimy<br></li><li>Tons of fixes, tweaks and optimizations</p><br><h1>UPDATE 4</h1><p></li><li>Added cooperative for Shaanti planet.<br></li><li>Added Chinese localization (store text only, full loc pending).<br></li><li>Added four different firing modes for laser sword.<br></li><li>Several stability fixes and optimizations.</p><br><h1>UPDATE 3</h1><p></li><li>New planet Shaanti with four different locations and five difficulty settings.<br></li><li>3 new game mechanics.<br></li><li>9 new enemies.<br></li><li>1 new boss.<br></li><li>Left hand weapon is no longer mirrored, so eventual texts on it will not look inverted.<br></li><li>Screen areas not visible due to HMD lens distortion are now masked and don't render, yielding better performance.<br></li><li>Fixed darker display on right eye when using RiftCat on some devices.<br></li><li>Mixed Reality now supports portrait camera mode. This makes it easier to fit a human actor inside the frame.<br></li><li>Some menu buttons in some menus were clipped. Fixed. (Most notably in Mixed Reality Wizard, Credits menu, etc)<br></li><li>Improved Performance auto-detection, for cases where single-pass VR rendering is used.<br></li><li>Fixed in-game menu sometimes not opening in front of player in room-scale setups.<br></li><li>Tons of stability fixes and optimizations.</p><br><h1>UPDATE 2</h1><p></li><li>Added two-player coop mode: play campaign with your friends online.<br></li><li>Added two new difficulty settings: tourist and serious (both in single player and coop mode).<br></li><li>Weapon pricing inside store (shotgun is a little cheaper, laser ammo is a bit cheaper)<br></li><li>Adjusted health of certain enemies (Khnum has less health)<br></li><li>Various bug fixes.<br></li><li>Various performance optimizations.</p><br><h1>UPDATE 1</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added full support for Oculus Rift and Oculus Touch on SteamVR.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>nVidia VR SLI</strong> - Added support for nVidia VR SLI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multi-GPU setups, the game will now automatically use the GPU into which HMD is connected.<br>Minor gameplay fixes and tweaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various performance optimizations.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Serious Sam está de volta! E desta vez é REAL!</li></ul>",
