                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 7 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel Core i5 - 4590 equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 6 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> AMD R9 290 or NVIDIA GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 10 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Compatibilidade com R.V.:</strong> SteamVR or Oculus PC<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> HTC Vive or Oculus Rift VR headset plus hand controllers. Internet connection required for product activation for the first time. After that, a persistent connection is not required to play SSVR: The Last Hope.</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel Core i7-6800 equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> AMD Fury or NVIDIA GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 10 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> HTC Vive or Oculus Rift VR headset plus hand controllers. Internet connection required for product activation for the first time. After that, a persistent connection is not required to play SSVR: The Last Hope.</li></ul>"
